     "x": 0.14,
     "y": 0.07,
     "width": 0.72,
     "height": 0.22
    }
   ],
   "line": "Tyger Tyger, burning bright, / In the forests of the night; / What immortal hand or eye, / Could frame thy fearful symmetry?",
   "startMs": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "distant-deeps-and-skies",
   "image": "/poetry/tyger/scenes/02-distant-deeps-and-skies.webp",
   "lines": 4,
   "focalPoint": {
    "x": 0.45,
    "y": 0.45
   },
   "textPreset": "searchlight-scan",
   "transitionMs": 1200,
   "safeZones": [
    {
     "x": 0.08,
     "y": 0.66,
     "width": 0.84,
     "height": 0.18
    }
   ],
   "line": "In what distant deeps or skies. / Burnt the fire of thine eyes? / On what wings dare he aspire? / What the hand, dare seize the fire?",
   "startMs": 10640
  },
  {
   "id": "hammer-chain-furnace",
   "image": "/poetry/tyger/scenes/03-hammer-chain-furnace.webp",
   "lines": 8,
   "focalPoint": {
    "x": 0.5,
    "y": 0.55
   },
   "textPreset": "uniform-formation",
   "transitionMs": 1080,
   "safeZones": [
    {
     "x": 0.3,
     "y": 0.07,
     "width": 0.5,
     "height": 0.2
    }
   ],
   "line": "And what shoulder, & what art, / Could twist the sinews of thy heart? / And when thy heart began to beat, / What dread hand? & what dread feet? / What the hammer? what the chain, / In what furnace was thy brain? / What the anvil? what dread grasp, / Dare its deadly terrors clasp!",
   "startMs": 21760
  },
  {
   "id": "tiger-and-lamb",
   "image": "/poetry/tyger/scenes/04-tiger-and-lamb.webp",
   "lines": 4,
   "focalPoint": {
    "x": 0.5,
    "y": 0.6
   },
   "textPreset": "quiet-breath",
   "transitionMs": 1440,
   "safeZones": [
    {
     "x": 0.36,
     "y": 0.08,
     "width": 0.56,
     "height": 0.24
    }
   ],
   "line": "When the stars threw down their spears / And water’d heaven with their tears: / Did he smile his work to see? / Did he who made the Lamb make thee?",
   "startMs": 44240
  },
  {
   "id": "burning-bright-again",
